      "content": "i mean yeah, the chef thing makes sense but it's kind of a simple metaphor. i'm trying to understand the actual math-physics part. how is the integral actually \"picking out\" the frequencies? like, is there some kind of interaction happening between the signal and the sine waves that makes the others disappear?",
